The most recent version of the Vauxhall Vectra available with the 'GSi' trim is the Vectra B (1995-2002), specifically the facelifted models from 1999-2002, which included 2.5L and 2.6L V6 engines. There was also a 3.2 V6 GSi mentioned in one source as a 2002 model, but this seems to be a less common variant or potentially a different market designation, as the Vectra C GSi typically had the 3.2 V6. Given the focus on the *most recent* version *with this trim*, and the prevalence of the Vectra B GSi in search results, this evaluation focuses on the Vectra B GSi, primarily the 2.5L and 2.6L V6 models.

